graph TB
    subgraph "llm-d-planner"
        subgraph Backend["Backend (FastAPI :8000)"]
            API["REST API Gateway"]
            IntentEngine["Intent Extraction Engine"]
            SpecEngine["Specification Generator"]
            RecEngine["Recommendation Engine<br/>(Quality/Price/Latency Scoring)"]
            ConfigEngine["Configuration Generator<br/>(KServe/vLLM Templates)"]
            ClusterMgr["Cluster Manager<br/>(GPU Detection, Deploy)"]
            KB["Knowledge Base<br/>(SQLite + Benchmarks)"]
            QualityScoring["Quality Scoring<br/>(Arena + Artificial Analysis)"]
        end

        subgraph UI["UI (Streamlit :8501)"]
            Chat["Conversational Chat"]
            SpecEditor["Specification Editor"]
            RecDisplay["Recommendation Display"]
            DeployMonitor["Deployment Monitor"]
        end
    end

    User[User / Browser] -->|HTTPS via Route| UI
    Chat -->|HTTP :8000| API
    SpecEditor -->|HTTP :8000| API
    RecDisplay -->|HTTP :8000| API
    DeployMonitor -->|HTTP :8000| API

    API --> IntentEngine
    API --> SpecEngine
    API --> RecEngine
    API --> ConfigEngine
    API --> ClusterMgr
    API --> KB
    API --> QualityScoring

    IntentEngine -->|HTTP :11434| Ollama["Ollama LLM Service"]
    IntentEngine -->|HTTPS :443| OpenAI["OpenAI API"]
    RecEngine --> KB
    RecEngine --> QualityScoring
    ConfigEngine -->|Jinja2 templates| KServeYAML["KServe InferenceService YAML"]
    ClusterMgr -->|HTTPS :6443| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    KB -->|File I/O| SQLite["SQLite DB (PVC)"]
    QualityScoring -->|HTTPS :443| Arena["Arena API"]
    QualityScoring -->|HTTPS :443| AA["Artificial Analysis API"]

    API -->|HTTPS :443| HFHub["HuggingFace Hub"]
    KB -->|HTTPS :8443| ModelCatalog["RHOAI Model Catalog"]

